{"nodes": [{"id": "prompts_agent_one_payment_knowledge_extraction_task", "label": "Payment knowledge extraction task (read-only agent brief)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "prompts/agent-one.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rather than copying the portal's payment code into a new project, a senior-dev agent reads the live implementation and writes a faithful knowledge document a second agent can build from \u2014 keeping the source project untouched while transferring the hard-won gateway details."}, {"id": "prompts_agent_one_payment_knowledge_md", "label": "PAYMENT_KNOWLEDGE.md deliverable", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "prompts/agent-one.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Seven fixed sections (Titan flow, Paystack flow, database, post-payment, routes, config keys, lessons/gotchas); every snippet must be copied from real code, missing files flagged as NOT FOUND, and all credentials replaced with dummy placeholders."}, {"id": "prompts_agent_one_read_only_constraint", "label": "Read-only extraction constraint", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "prompts/agent-one.md", "source_location": "line 6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "DO NOT build anything, DO NOT modify any files \u2014 the production school portal must not be destabilised by a documentation pass."}, {"id": "prompts_agent_one_tgi_titan_gateway", "label": "TGI Titan payment gateway", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "prompts/agent-one.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Redirect-style gateway: initiation POST with signed fields, customer redirect to a hosted page, then a webhook callback that must be signature-verified before the payment record is marked paid."}, {"id": "prompts_agent_one_titan_hmac_signature", "label": "Titan HMAC/signature construction", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "prompts/agent-one.md", "source_location": "lines 32, 36", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "What is hashed, with which key, and in what field order is the single most error-prone part of the integration, so the knowledge doc must capture it verbatim."}, {"id": "prompts_agent_one_titan_webhook_handler", "label": "Titan webhook/callback handler", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "prompts/agent-one.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompts_agent_one_paystack_gateway", "label": "Paystack payment gateway", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "prompts/agent-one.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompts_agent_one_paystack_verification", "label": "Paystack server-side verification", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "prompts/agent-one.md", "source_location": "lines 40-42", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Inline-JS or redirect, the backend must re-verify the reference against Paystack's verify endpoint with the secret token before updating the DB \u2014 the frontend callback alone is not trusted."}, {"id": "prompts_agent_one_payment", "label": "Payment model / payments table", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "prompts/agent-one.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompts_agent_one_payment_routes", "label": "Payment routes (routes/web.php, routes/api.php)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "prompts/agent-one.md", "source_location": "lines 16, 65-67", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompts_agent_one_config_services", "label": "config/services.php gateway config keys", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "prompts/agent-one.md", "source_location": "line 17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompts_agent_one_env_dummy_credentials_rule", "label": "Dummy-credential rule for extracted config keys", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "prompts/agent-one.md", "source_location": "lines 20, 68-70", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only payment-related keys are lifted from .env.example and every value is replaced with a placeholder (TITAN_SECRET=your_titan_secret_here) so a shared knowledge doc never carries live secrets."}, {"id": "prompts_agent_one_post_payment_document_generation", "label": "Post-payment success redirect and PDF generation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "prompts/agent-one.md", "source_location": "lines 21-22, 62-64", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompts_agent_one_csrf_exclusion_gotcha", "label": "Webhook CSRF exclusion and retry gotchas", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "prompts/agent-one.md", "source_location": "lines 72-74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gateway callbacks are external POSTs with no session, so they must be excluded from CSRF middleware; retry logic and other non-obvious edge cases are the things a fresh agent reimplementing the flow is most likely to get wrong."}, {"id": "prompts_agent_one_beach_event_ticketing_system", "label": "Beach event ticketing system (target project)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "prompts/agent-one.md", "source_location": "line 4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "prompts_agent_one_payment_knowledge_extraction_task", "target": "prompts_agent_one_payment_knowledge_md", "relation": "re